{"title":"Tome Tailoring Dragonscale","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Baby Red Dragon, Young Red Dragon</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 4 of 489 looted corpses (1/122)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/122<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"baby-red-dragon\" title=\"Baby Red Dragon - dropped it in 6 of 1,259 looted corpses (1/210)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7aca051983df137719ab.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Baby Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/210<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"tome-tailoring-dragonscale\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/b07ca7bf7da10e5b278c.svg\" alt=\"Tome Tailoring Dragonscale\"></div><h3>Tome Tailoring Dragonscale</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/24/2026, 10:28:12 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}